     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "On Joy Ridge, a row of linked platforms runs across 45'9\" x 34'6\", joined by bridges and a net tunnel. Slides shaped like octopus legs come down from the decks beside tube slides, all in Play Orange and Lavender Dilly. Children spend much of their time moving between towers, crawling the net tunnel and hanging from bars before they choose a slide. Key users are 3 to 12 years and the age group starts at 3. That spread works for a school that shares one play area between pre-primary and primary classes. Listed capacity is 15 and the safe play area is 50'9\" x 39'6\". Its pipes, moulded parts, laminates and play rope carry 3 years of warranty cover. Once you share your site size, we can send a layout drawing."
     }
